	'k4e408a08' => 'Wednesdays focus on heart failure management, chronic breathlessness, fluid retention, and complex medication adjustments under Dr. Samuel Osei. This clinic brings together detailed physical examination, symptom assessment, and routine monitoring of kidney function and electrolyte stability. Jonas Berg, our cardiac nurse, coordinates between consultations to check symptom diaries and answer practical questions about fluid balance. Consultations operate at an unhurried pace between 08:30 and 17:00, allowing Dr. Osei to review multi-drug therapies, verify stability, and arrange planned three-month check-ins.',
