	'k7eee9a44' => 'At Ibuki Cardiology, we operate on a predictable schedule that values your working week. Our diagnostic pathways ensure your consultation, electrocardiogram, and echocardiogram occur during a single unhurried ninety-minute appointment. You consult directly with your cardiologist, receive a clear management plan before leaving, and know exactly when our team will follow up.',
