	'k964c0f2e' => 'Lucía registered for her first distance marathon and sought a comprehensive cardiovascular evaluation due to a family history of premature heart disease. She attended our Thursday Imaging Day for a transthoracic echocardiogram with Priya Natarajan and completed an exercise treadmill stress test with Dr. Tomás Ribeiro during Friday\'s Prevention Clinic. The evaluation confirmed normal ventricular dimensions and reassuring exercise capacity, giving Lucía clear heart rate parameters and medical clearance for structured endurance training.',
