	'kcec86e64' => 'Care does not conclude when your first appointment ends. Diagnostic test results are reviewed within fourteen days, followed by structured check-ins at intervals of three, six, or twelve months depending on your clinical plan. We reserve subsequent appointment dates in advance so ongoing monitoring remains uninterrupted. Booking and schedule changes are managed through three simple, dependable channels.',
