	'kd458c50f' => '45 minutes',
	'kd5f0f146' => 'Scheduling a follow-up review is straightforward and flexible. First, patients can submit an online booking request at any time, which our team reviews and confirms within one working day. Second, you may contact our front desk by telephone at +1 555 0142 between 08:00 and 17:30 Monday through Friday. Third, our dedicated follow-up desk is open for in-person booking and administrative support between 13:00 and 16:00 on weekdays, where patient coordinator Amara Diallo and nurse Jonas Berg assist with appointment timing.',
