	'kd74551f5' => 'Clinic location and access',
	'kd7cf1ed6' => 'Hana recorded elevated blood pressure readings in the school staff room but found that readings varied considerably between morning and afternoon classes. She visited our Tuesday Blood Pressure Clinic, where Dr. Tomás Ribeiro fitted an automated 24-hour monitor to capture cuff measurements during teaching hours and overnight rest. The resulting data revealed nighttime elevations that guided a specific medication adjustment. Hana now maintains a reliable home monitoring protocol and checks in at regular intervals.',
