	'kf63484ee' => 'When cardiac symptoms appear, waiting weeks for an appointment only compounds anxiety. Traditional outpatient clinics often stack consultations back to back, leaving patients stranded in crowded waiting rooms while testing equipment sits behind administrative bottlenecks. Patients leave without a clear explanation of their condition or a firm date for when their test results will be reviewed.',
